吗？或者说……这不是身体原主的说话口气。后一种猜测可能性比较大，毕竟身子中换了人，怎么可能没什么破绽，何况，她还真不知原主是什么样的人。她不敢让人知晓借尸还魂，若是在现代，就会被拉到实验室中当小白鼠，而在古代情况更惨，搞不好就当怪物一般活活烧死。何况，那叫翠儿的丫鬟现在还记恨着她。老人姓马，平日里人们都叫他老马头，是苏涟漪哥哥家的帮工，来李府送货本来是他的任务，奈何这苏涟漪非喜欢上李家二公子的美色，死活要跟着来，而东家苏皓却是个疼妹妹的，就让她任性的跟来。“刘妈妈，天色不早了，我先走了，下回再来叨扰刘妈妈吧。”涟漪尽量挤出喜庆的笑，殊不知在这满是横肉的脸上，笑起来多可怖。“还有下回？”刘妈妈毫不客气的冷哼，“苏涟漪，李府可是苏家酒厂最大的买家，若是你再不识抬举前来纠缠二少爷，生意没了，这责任你可担不起。”涟漪这回算是听明白了，闹了半天，这本尊哥哥家开了酒厂，李家是买家，每次送酒本尊都跟过来，为的就是勾引二少爷，而刚刚那些丫鬟衣料昂贵讲究，搞不好就是所谓二少爷身旁的丫鬟，她们跑来教训本尊，不慎将本尊推倒摔死，于是便有了她的借尸还魂。一边想着，一边去摸后脑，刚一触碰，只觉得撕拉拉的疼，那位置正好和前世她致死伤口的位置相同。一样的死因，相同的名字，难道她的借尸还魂不是偶尔而有渊源？伸手碰到了腰带，古人喜欢在腰带里掖一些东西，方便拿取，就好像现代人喜欢在裤兜里放上一些零钱一样。腰带中有了一些碎银子，涟漪不知道这是多少钱，一股脑的都取了出来，笑着上前几步握住刘妈妈的手，“您老这是说玩笑话吧，涟漪即便是再来也是看刘妈妈，没事儿多与刘妈妈聊聊，也是受益匪浅。”两人双手交握，只见那刘妈妈一扫之前的刻薄，脸上勉强挤出了些许慈爱，“这才对嘛，涟漪下回来李府不找刘妈妈，妈妈是会挑理的。”满是皱纹的老手暗暗接过碎银子，好家伙，足有一两之多。……已是下午，阳光渐隐，时值春季，刚刚的些许燥热因出了厨房全无。以翠儿为首的一群丫鬟们看刘妈妈突然转变的态度十分惊讶，老马头自然也是震惊。刘妈妈在李府后院也算个人物，怎么突然就对苏涟漪和颜悦色？道理很简单，拿人钱财，替人消灾。涟漪送钱是为苏家酒厂留一条路后，虽不知这招好不好用，但也死马当活马医。好在，刘妈妈好像真吃这一套。“天色不早了，你先回苏家庄吧，以后办事多用点脑，三思而后行。”刘妈妈像模像样的叮嘱。涟漪点头，收回了手，“刘妈妈叮嘱的是，那我便先回去了，让刘妈妈操心了。”后者点了点头，不动声色地将银子收了起来，目送苏涟漪和老马头离去。出了李府，上了送货的小驴车，吱嘎吱嘎地向回走，苏涟漪舒了口气，后背一片冰凉——终于脱离了险境。那刘妈妈是个毒辣的角色，处理人命丝毫不眨眼，好在那翠儿还嫩，不似刘妈妈那般老练，否则若早早将她扔井里，她也活不下来。驴车向前走，涟漪回首看向李府，朱红大门耸立，门前一对石狮子生威。这种所谓的名门望族、深宅大院，哪有干净的？看似金碧辉煌，实则是黑暗无底！无论如何，今后她都不会再踏足这里了。回头，看见正在赶车的人，微微一笑“大叔，刚刚对不住了，让您找了那么久。”最首要的任务，还是了解下现在的世界。老马头听见涟漪的称呼，吓得差点从小驴车上摔下去，被后者眼疾手快的一把抓住。“大叔，您这是怎么了？”涟漪惊讶。老半天，老马头才勉强找到自己声音，“涟……涟漪，你今天是怎么了，为什么突然这么客气？”让他受宠若惊。涟漪楞了一下，肯定了之前的猜想，本尊平日里多半粗鲁无礼的。“大叔，不瞒您说，刚刚我确实和那翠儿打了起来，伤到了头，现在头还晕晕的，脑子有些不清明。”说着，便撩起了袖子，土绿色的粗布衣袖下，白胖的胳膊确实有一块块淤青。“那你挨了欺负，怎么不和刘妈妈说？”老马头是个农村老头，淳朴善良，思想也简单的很，真就以为刘妈妈与她交好。苏涟漪忍不住轻笑，知道对方定然看不出刚刚发生的门道，无奈摇摇头，“没什么大事，我身强力壮，回头养养就好了，多一事不如少一事，哥哥家做点生意也不容易。”老马头再次因震惊差点摔下马车，“涟……涟……涟漪，你不会真摔坏了脑子吧？”这种话，怎么可能是苏涟漪这个十里八村最出名的女恶棍说的？“大叔，你觉得从前的涟漪好，还是现在的涟漪好？”她眨眨眼，微笑着说。“当然是……现在的。”老马头最终还是忍不住说了实话。“那以后涟漪便永远如此，但，还请大叔给我讲一讲家里的情况，帮我顺顺思路。”于是，老式淳朴的老马头便开始耐心的讲解这个世界的一切，苏涟漪听完，大吃一惊。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/mingyiguinu/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "First Arriving in Another World 002, Dangerous Situation A simple sentence contained a lot of information, but Su Lianyi had no time to sort it out. The top priority was to leave this so-called Li Mansion and escape from danger. Mother Liu turned around and left, and Ripple immediately followed. Not far from the kitchen, she heard someone calling her, \"Ripple, so you are here, making it easy for me to find you.\" Ripple followed the voice and saw an old man not far away, wearing earth-brown shorts and looking anxious. The old man should know her, her tone of voice was familiar, and judging from her anxious look and profuse sweating, he must have been looking for her for a long time. Secretly breathing a sigh of relief, she also pretended to be very familiar with her, \"Yeah, I'm here, I've kept you looking for me for a long time, thank you for your hard work.\" Not to mention the old man was stunned, even Mother Liu next to her was also stunned, and then looked at her with a look of shock and unfamiliarity. Su Lianyi looked calm and natural on the face, but her heart was ringing with alarm bells - what was going on? Isn't that right? In other words...this is not the tone of voice of the original owner of the body. The latter guess is more likely. After all, there is a different person in the body, so how can there be no flaws? Besides, she really doesn't know what kind of person the original owner is. She didn't dare to let people know that she was resurrecting a corpse. If she were in modern times, she would be dragged into a laboratory and used as a guinea pig. But in ancient times, the situation was even worse. She might be burned alive like a monster. What's more, the maid named Cui'er still hates her. The old man's surname was Ma, and people usually called him Lao Ma Tou. He was a helper at Su Lianyi's brother's house. It was his duty to deliver goods to Li's house. However, Su Lianyi fell in love with the beauty of the second son of the Li family and wanted to follow him. However, his boss Su Hao loved his sister and let her follow him as she pleased. \"Mother Liu, it's getting late. I'm leaving now. I'll come back to bother Mother Liu next time.\" Lianyi tried her best to squeeze out a festive smile, but she didn't know how terrifying the smile looked on this face full of flesh. \"What about the next time?\" Liu's mother snorted unceremoniously, \"Su Lianyi, the Li family is the largest buyer of the Su family winery. If you don't know how to show off and come to pester the second young master, the business will be gone. You can't bear the responsibility.\" Lianyi finally understood this time. When we arrived at the winery, the Li family was the buyer. Every time I delivered wine, I came with him in order to seduce the second young master. But those maids just now were wearing expensive and exquisite clothes. Maybe they were the so-called maids next to the second young master. They came to teach me a lesson, but accidentally pushed me down and fell to death, so she was resurrected. While thinking about it, he touched the back of his head. As soon as he touched it, he felt a tearing pain. The location was exactly the same as the location of her fatal wound in her previous life. The same cause of death and the same name. Could it be that her resurrection was not accidental but had a connection? He reached out and touched his belt. Ancient people liked to tuck some things in their belts for easy access, just like modern people like to put some change in their trouser pockets. There was some broken silver in the belt. Ripple didn't know how much it was, so he took it out all at once. He smiled and stepped forward to hold Mother Liu's hand. \"You must be joking. Even if Ripple comes back, he will always visit Mother Liu. If he has nothing to do, he will benefit a lot from chatting with Mother Liu.\" \"The two of them clasped their hands, and saw that Mother Liu wiped away her previous harshness, and managed to squeeze out some kindness on her face, \"That's right. If you don't talk to Mother Liu when you come back to the Li Mansion, she will find fault.\" The wrinkled old hand secretly took the broken silver, good guy, there are enough. ...It is already afternoon, the sun is fading, it is spring, and the slight heat just now is gone after leaving the kitchen. A group of maids headed by Cui'er were very surprised to see Liu's mother's sudden change of attitude. Naturally, Lao Ma Tou was also shocked. Mother Liu was considered a figure in the backyard of the Li Mansion, so why did she suddenly become so kind to Su Lianyi? The principle is very simple, take people's money and eliminate disasters for them. Lianyi gave the money to clear a way for the Su family winery. Although he didn't know if this trick would work, it was still a dead horse. Fortunately, Mother Liu seems to really like this. \"It's getting late. You should go back to Sujiazhuang first. Use your brain more when doing things in the future and think twice before you act.\" Mother Liu warned her in a decent manner. Lianyi nodded and retracted her hand, \"Mother Liu told me, then I will go back first and let Mother Liu worry about it.\" The latter nodded, quietly put away the money, and watched Su Lianyi and Lao Ma Tou leave. After leaving Li's Mansion, she got on the delivery donkey cart and walked back creakingly. Su Lianyi breathed a sigh of relief, her back feeling cold - she was finally out of danger. That Mother Liu is a vicious character who handles human life without blinking an eye. Fortunately, Na Cui'er is still young and not as experienced as Mother Liu. Otherwise, if she were thrown into the well early, she would not survive. The donkey cart moved forward, and Ripple looked back at Li Mansion. The vermilion gate stood tall, and a pair of stone lions looked powerful in front of the door. How can such a so-called famous family and a deep mansion be clean? It looks resplendent, but in fact it is bottomless darkness! No matter what, she will never set foot here again in the future. Looking back, I saw the man driving the car and smiled slightly, \"Uncle, I'm sorry for making you look for so long.\" The most important task is to understand the current world. When Lao Ma Tou heard Ripple's name, he was so frightened that he almost fell off the donkey cart, but was caught by the latter with quick eyes and hands. \"Uncle, what's wrong with you?\" Ripple was surprised. It took a long time for Lao Ma Tou to finally find his voice, \"Lian...Lianyi, what's wrong with you today? Why are you so polite all of a sudden?\" He was flattered. Ripples hesitated for a moment, confirming his previous guess. I am usually rude and rude. \"Uncle, to tell you the truth, I did have a fight with that Cui'er just now and hurt my head. Now I'm still dizzy and my brain is a little unclear.\" After saying that, he rolled up his sleeves. Under the earth-green coarse cloth sleeves, there were indeed bruises on his white and fat arms. \"Then you were bullied, why?", "translated": true, "title_en": "Chapter 2"}